        { code: '    [SerializeField] private int coins;', what: 'How many coins you have collected. An `int` (whole number), exposed to the Inspector so you can watch it change while the game runs.' , why: 'Declared in the **class body**, not inside the method — the same rule from 1.3. This is state that has to still be there on the next frame, so it belongs to the object.' },
