        { code: '        if (other.CompareTag("Coin"))', what: 'Check **what** you just touched before doing anything. `CompareTag` asks the engine directly; comparing tag strings with `==` builds a new string every call and can silently miss.' , why: 'Spikes, cave entrances and healing pickups will all land in this same method before the unit is over. Without this check, the Player would vanish the first time it walked into a wall that happened to have a collider.' },
